https://ollama.com/download

=C2=A0
Ollama now supports Cline CLI, an =
open coding agent for your editor and terminal. Cline can read your =
repository, make file
changes, run commands, and show code diffs for review=
.


Get started

Download Ollama [https://ollama.com/download] and run:
=C2=A0
ollama launch cline
=C2=A0
Use a local model to run on your machine:
ollama launch cline --model qwen3.6
=C2=A0
Use a cloud model for complex, =
long tasks:
ollama launch cline --model kimi-k2.6:cloud
=C2=A0


Parallel tasks

Cline can work on parallel tasks through a Kanban board.



=C2=A0
You can start the Cline kanban board directly from Ollama:
ollama launch cline -- kanban
=C2=A0
If you have any feedback, please reply=
 directly to this email or join Ollama=E2=80=99s Discord [https://discord.=
gg/ollama].
=C2=A0
=E2=9D=A4=EF=B8=8F Ollama
=C2=A0
